Package: yamr
Title: Client for the 'Yandex Metrica' API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Artem", "Rogozhin", , "tem19@live.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access the 'Yandex Metrica' web analytics API
    <https://yandex.com/dev/metrika/>. Currently covers the Logs API, which
    exports raw, non-aggregated session ('visits') and event ('hits') data:
    evaluating, creating, polling, downloading, and cleaning log requests,
    with typed parsing of the exported data and OAuth authorization.
